# Shuttle — commit message template (installed by scripts/git/setup.sh)
#
# <type>(<scope>): <description>
#
# types: feat fix hotfix chore docs refactor test perf build ci style revert release
# scope: optional, e.g. runtime, admin, builder — comma-separated for several
#        feat(builder, cargo-shuttle): ...
# description: imperative, lowercase is not required, <= 72 chars, no trailing period
# body: why, wrapped at 72
# footer: Refs: #123
#
# Recorded as wip: for checkpoints. No AI attribution — the human is the sole author.
#
# This template is comments only on purpose: comment lines are stripped by git and
# by .githooks/commit-msg, so nothing here can become a real commit subject, and
# nothing here can trip the attribution rule.
#
# Lines starting with '#' are ignored.
